WEBVTT

00:19.185 --> 00:20.478
Sir Tokito…

00:23.648 --> 00:26.276
Don't ever underestimate me,
you little brat.

00:44.502 --> 00:47.505
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

02:01.121 --> 02:05.959
EPISODE 9:
MIST HASHIRA MUICHIRO TOKITO

02:09.045 --> 02:11.923
No, I'm not underestimating you.

02:12.006 --> 02:13.967
I'm just stating a fact.

02:14.050 --> 02:17.720
You're gonna die from me
cutting off your head in any case.

02:18.263 --> 02:22.225
Because right now,
I feel like I'm in good shape.

02:23.268 --> 02:24.519
I wonder why.

02:25.019 --> 02:29.482
That right there! You're underestimating
me from your tone, you brat!

02:29.566 --> 02:33.695
You've hardly been alive
more than 10 years.

02:38.116 --> 02:42.745
That being said, there's not a single
thing about you I can respect.

02:43.913 --> 02:48.167
The way you look and the way you talk
are disgusting.

02:48.251 --> 02:51.504
You're just too uncultured and poor

02:51.588 --> 02:58.052
to understand
my beauty, grace, and elegance.

02:58.136 --> 03:02.390
Like showing a book
to an illiterate latrine bug!

03:02.473 --> 03:05.935
You're the one who looks like
he lives in a chamber pot.

03:06.019 --> 03:07.896
Shut up, you latrine bug!

03:07.979 --> 03:14.027
That blade is as short as your limbs.
It can't reach my neck.

03:14.110 --> 03:17.405
No. It definitely did a minute ago.

03:17.488 --> 03:20.533
And anyway, your limbs are shorter.

03:20.617 --> 03:24.746
Oh, were you talking to yourself?

03:24.829 --> 03:26.539
Sorry for interrupting.

03:28.249 --> 03:30.418
What a cheap provocation.

03:30.501 --> 03:33.588
Did you think I, Gyokko,
would be upset by that?

03:33.671 --> 03:37.926
You seem desperate to win. It's unsightly.

03:40.511 --> 03:41.930
UPPER
FIVE

03:42.013 --> 03:43.431
What's wrong?

03:44.140 --> 03:45.725
I was just wondering.

03:45.808 --> 03:49.062
Is that vase distorted in shape?

03:49.646 --> 03:51.940
It doesn't look symmetrical.

03:53.191 --> 03:55.276
What poor workmanship.

03:56.402 --> 04:01.074
That's because your eyeballs are rotten!

04:01.157 --> 04:08.122
What's distorted about my vase's shape?

04:08.706 --> 04:09.999
Blood Demon Art:

04:11.459 --> 04:14.295
Ten Thousand Gliding Slime-Fish!

04:14.379 --> 04:18.591
These 10,000 assassins
will devour you down to your bones!

04:18.675 --> 04:21.511
And then, I'll make you one of my arts!

04:21.594 --> 04:22.887
Mist Breathing,

04:27.100 --> 04:30.353
Sixth Form: Lunar Dispersing Mist.

04:36.192 --> 04:39.570
He cut them all down?

04:39.654 --> 04:42.365
Such speed and range of attack!

04:42.448 --> 04:45.493
Where did my poison go?

04:45.576 --> 04:47.328
That was unexpected.

04:47.412 --> 04:49.789
But it's no problem.

04:49.872 --> 04:52.250
When cut by a Nichirin Sword,

04:52.333 --> 04:55.670
my slime fish spray poison
before they turn to dust.

04:55.753 --> 05:01.134
Moreover, the poison's toxicity is
absorbed through the skin.

05:01.217 --> 05:03.886
Once it touches him, he'll die.

05:03.970 --> 05:08.725
Mist Breathing, Third Form:
Scattering Mist Splash.

05:15.231 --> 05:17.442
What!

05:17.525 --> 05:20.945
He deflected all of it
with a rotation move!

05:25.033 --> 05:26.784
He can even shed his skin.

05:30.913 --> 05:33.291
What a pain.

05:33.374 --> 05:36.753
Would you stop dodging
and climbing up trees?

05:39.130 --> 05:43.009
I will show you my true form.

05:43.092 --> 05:44.260
Yeah, yeah.

05:46.387 --> 05:49.891
You're the third person I've showed it to.

05:49.974 --> 05:51.184
Three is a lot.

05:51.267 --> 05:52.435
Shut up!

05:52.518 --> 05:56.773
Once I get serious, no one survives!

05:57.315 --> 05:58.608
Very impressive.

05:59.942 --> 06:02.695
Shut your mouth, you stupid brat!

06:02.779 --> 06:08.117
These transparent scales are
harder and stronger than diamonds.

06:08.201 --> 06:10.912
I refined this inside my vase.

06:10.995 --> 06:16.751
Kneel before this perfect, beautiful form!

06:27.136 --> 06:31.224
Say something, you dunce!

06:31.307 --> 06:34.644
You're really getting under my scales,
damn it!

06:34.727 --> 06:37.939
Well, you did tell me to shut my mouth.

06:38.564 --> 06:39.732
Also,

06:40.316 --> 06:42.110
I'm not really that impressed.

06:57.750 --> 07:01.254
Didn't you tell me
not to climb up the trees?

07:01.337 --> 07:03.464
Look at yourself now.

07:04.173 --> 07:08.261
I'm only up here because you stink.
My nose can't handle it.

07:08.344 --> 07:11.556
What do you think of my godlike hands?

07:11.639 --> 07:15.935
Anything my fists touch
will turn into beautiful fish.

07:16.018 --> 07:17.770
Not to mention my speed!

07:17.854 --> 07:21.149
My body is flexible and tough!

07:21.232 --> 07:25.194
And these scales enable me
to move quickly in any direction.

07:25.278 --> 07:27.071
As freely as I like!

07:28.531 --> 07:31.742
You're trembling. Are you scared?

07:31.826 --> 07:34.829
My attacks earlier weren't even serious.

07:41.919 --> 07:45.882
No matter how great your attacks are,
they're useless if they don't hit.

07:47.925 --> 07:51.888
Remember that boiling rage.

07:58.060 --> 08:02.899
I saw maggots crawling over
my beloved brother as his body rotted.

08:04.567 --> 08:07.487
They even got into my body.

08:07.570 --> 08:09.655
I was on the brink of death.

08:15.036 --> 08:16.496
Prepare the hot water, hurry!

08:16.579 --> 08:19.207
Cover his wounds with clean cloth!

08:19.290 --> 08:20.333
Understood.

08:25.671 --> 08:26.964
How is the older brother?

08:27.048 --> 08:29.091
He's already drawn his last breath.

08:29.175 --> 08:32.136
We can't afford to let the younger die.

08:32.220 --> 08:33.095
Understood.

08:35.473 --> 08:37.808
Big brother…

08:49.445 --> 08:51.822
If I hadn't been lucky enough
to be rescued,

08:51.906 --> 08:54.200
I would have died soon after.

09:00.748 --> 09:04.502
Sir Tokito, you haven't fully healed yet.

09:06.212 --> 09:09.840
Even if I lose my memory,
my body remembers.

09:14.762 --> 09:17.181
The rage that won't leave me until I die.

09:20.309 --> 09:25.606
It's the reason I trained so hard
that I vomited blood.

09:26.190 --> 09:28.109
To destroy demons.

09:28.192 --> 09:31.112
To eradicate all of them.

09:31.195 --> 09:35.157
Behold my splendor as I get serious!

09:35.241 --> 09:38.828
Blood Demon Art: Killer Fish Scales!

09:41.247 --> 09:45.960
How do you like these moves
that defy the laws of nature?

09:46.043 --> 09:48.170
I can move freely because of my scales!

09:48.254 --> 09:50.006
It's impossible to predict!

09:50.089 --> 09:53.801
I love defying the laws of nature!

09:53.884 --> 09:57.263
Now, how should I cook your body?

09:57.346 --> 10:02.268
I'll rip off your ugly head and replace it
with a beautiful fish head instead!

10:03.519 --> 10:05.605
This is the end.

10:08.107 --> 10:10.776
Mist Breathing, Seventh Form:

10:11.444 --> 10:12.528
Obscuring Clouds.

10:18.701 --> 10:20.036
No, over there!

10:20.119 --> 10:21.120
I've got you!

10:22.872 --> 10:24.123
He's gone?

10:26.542 --> 10:28.002
Over there!

10:28.628 --> 10:29.837
Too late!

10:29.920 --> 10:32.298
What…

10:32.381 --> 10:33.966
How did he disappear?

10:35.384 --> 10:37.136
What's going on here?

10:37.219 --> 10:38.929
Where did he go?

10:39.013 --> 10:40.806
It's as if…

10:41.390 --> 10:44.310
he's shrouded in mist.

10:49.565 --> 10:51.233
Let me ask you.

10:52.234 --> 10:53.361
Why did you think…

10:55.488 --> 10:58.824
you were the only one who
wasn't being serious before?

11:12.630 --> 11:16.550
What? Everything's upside down.

11:16.634 --> 11:20.054
What's happening? My senses are gone!

11:20.137 --> 11:22.807
That brat finally showed himself!

11:22.890 --> 11:26.143
I have to kill him fast
and report this to Lord Muzan!

11:32.149 --> 11:35.611
He cut it off!

11:35.694 --> 11:38.572
He cut off my head!

11:38.656 --> 11:41.033
It's impossible! I don't believe it!

11:41.117 --> 11:42.993
What an extraordinary situation!

11:43.077 --> 11:45.329
I lost?

11:45.413 --> 11:50.126
My illustrious self lost to a child?

11:50.209 --> 11:52.878
This is your end. Goodbye.

11:52.962 --> 11:55.881
Don't ever be reborn again.

11:56.924 --> 12:00.386
Shit! This shouldn't be happening!

12:00.469 --> 12:05.057
I, Gyokko, losing my head to a mere human?
How dare you!

12:05.141 --> 12:07.935
You're a miserable lower lifeform!

12:08.018 --> 12:12.022
I am worth a hundred of you!

12:12.106 --> 12:15.151
I am the superior, chosen being!

12:15.234 --> 12:18.112
You're weak and only get old!

12:18.195 --> 12:21.615
It's thanks to my hands, my godlike hands…

12:21.699 --> 12:22.700
DESTROYER OF DEMONS

12:22.783 --> 12:25.995
…that your ridiculous, worthless lives
are turned into magnificent art!

12:26.078 --> 12:29.165
You lowly worms--

12:38.966 --> 12:40.301
That's enough.

12:41.719 --> 12:44.180
Just go to hell already.

12:51.103 --> 12:56.025
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

12:56.108 --> 13:01.030
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

13:17.713 --> 13:22.384
You should be open-minded
and flexible when you think, Muichiro.

13:24.345 --> 13:29.767
When you regain your true self,
you will become stronger.

13:37.399 --> 13:40.152
Just as the Master said.

13:40.945 --> 13:43.322
As long as I have my true self,

13:43.405 --> 13:46.450
I can stand on both feet
with my full strength.

13:47.701 --> 13:50.746
Once I know who I really am,

13:50.829 --> 13:55.459
the hesitation, confusion,
and frustration will all disappear.

13:55.543 --> 14:00.130
No demon will be able to escape my blade.

14:03.842 --> 14:05.844
Sir Tokito…

14:05.928 --> 14:07.096
Sir Tokito!

14:07.680 --> 14:10.349
Sir Tokito, thank goodness!

14:10.432 --> 14:11.809
Are you all right?

14:12.601 --> 14:14.311
Don't worry, I'm fine.

14:14.395 --> 14:16.146
Are you sure?

14:16.230 --> 14:19.567
Yeah, I feel great right now.

14:19.650 --> 14:23.320
I have to hurry to Tanjiro and his sister.

14:23.404 --> 14:26.532
You look extremely pale.

14:26.615 --> 14:28.492
Are you really sure you're okay?

14:28.576 --> 14:30.911
I'm totally fine.

14:30.995 --> 14:33.122
Didn't you hear me?

14:34.832 --> 14:36.625
You're huffing and puffing, sir.

14:36.709 --> 14:38.586
And your body is trembling, isn't it?

14:38.669 --> 14:40.004
-I'm fine, so…
-Sir, hang on!

14:40.087 --> 14:43.173
Would you please go to Kotetsu--

14:44.717 --> 14:46.844
You're foaming at the mouth!

14:48.304 --> 14:49.305
Sir Tokito!

14:49.388 --> 14:51.557
This is bad! Is he going to die?

14:51.640 --> 14:54.977
What should I do? Someone, help!

14:55.060 --> 14:56.520
Haganezuka!

14:58.522 --> 15:01.066
Haganezuka!

15:01.150 --> 15:03.152
That bastard isn't coming!

15:03.235 --> 15:06.989
Even when I was about to be killed,
he completely ignored it!

15:09.199 --> 15:10.993
He's choking on the foam!

15:11.076 --> 15:13.787
What should I do?

15:13.871 --> 15:15.789
You should turn him on his side.

15:17.458 --> 15:18.375
Okay.

15:25.299 --> 15:27.509
It's young Kotetsu's ghost!

15:27.593 --> 15:30.387
No, I'm not dead at all,
so I'm not a ghost.

15:30.471 --> 15:35.100
No, no! Ghosts don't know
that they're already dead!

15:35.184 --> 15:36.894
No, no. Look, I'm still alive.

15:36.977 --> 15:41.982
No, no! There's no way you're still alive
bleeding so much from your stomach!

15:42.566 --> 15:45.361
This blood is from my wounded arm.

15:45.444 --> 15:47.446
I was holding it and it got stuck.

15:47.529 --> 15:52.368
The wound is pretty deep,
so I might die if it doesn't stop.

15:52.868 --> 15:55.329
As for my stomach…

15:56.497 --> 16:00.751
I was saved by this sword guard
that Tanjiro entrusted to me.

16:01.919 --> 16:05.673
He said he wanted to put it
on his new sword.

16:13.847 --> 16:15.808
Let's do our best together as Hashira!

16:28.362 --> 16:29.363
See?

16:30.572 --> 16:32.658
It all worked out.

16:35.035 --> 16:36.161
Father…

16:37.705 --> 16:38.914
Mother…

16:46.588 --> 16:47.798
Muichiro.

16:57.474 --> 16:59.018
You did well.

17:01.854 --> 17:03.063
Big brother…

17:10.029 --> 17:11.363
Thank you.

17:21.498 --> 17:23.584
There are five tree dragon heads.

17:23.667 --> 17:26.253
They can stretch about 66 shaku.

17:26.336 --> 17:28.505
Okay, I figured one thing out.

17:28.589 --> 17:29.506
HATE

17:31.300 --> 17:34.178
Hinokami Kagura: Clear Blue--

18:03.916 --> 18:06.835
My… My eardrums burst.

18:06.919 --> 18:09.546
I'm dizzy. I can't get up.

18:09.630 --> 18:12.549
This is bad. Hurry, stand up! Quick!

18:12.633 --> 18:14.259
The attack is coming!

18:27.940 --> 18:30.526
He can also use
the four emotion demons' abilities.

18:31.443 --> 18:33.862
And the power is increasing.

18:38.742 --> 18:41.537
I don't have time to breathe.
I can't recover.

18:46.667 --> 18:50.254
Even if I know when an attack is coming,
I'm no longer able to counter.

18:52.214 --> 18:53.757
I can't keep breathing.

18:53.841 --> 18:57.386
But I'll manage
if I can get 66 shaku away.

18:57.845 --> 18:59.680
Okay, I should be good here.

19:08.313 --> 19:09.982
Use a technique!

19:10.065 --> 19:10.983
Slash it!

19:15.821 --> 19:18.240
UPPER - FOUR

19:38.427 --> 19:41.054
It's no use. I'll get crushed…

19:47.728 --> 19:48.854
This is the end for you.

20:12.711 --> 20:13.921
A Hashira?

20:16.965 --> 20:19.551
What a monster! What is that?

20:20.594 --> 20:21.637
Miss Kanroji!

20:21.720 --> 20:24.473
Are you okay? Sorry, I'm late.

20:24.556 --> 20:25.974
You were in quite a pinch.

20:30.270 --> 20:32.356
Miss Kanroji!

20:33.857 --> 20:34.942
Tanjiro.

20:35.692 --> 20:37.694
You can rest now!

20:37.778 --> 20:40.113
You did well! Good job!

20:40.197 --> 20:42.991
I can't hear what she's saying
with these burst eardrums.

20:46.245 --> 20:47.788
Tanjiro.

20:51.250 --> 20:54.253
I'll save Nezuko and Genya.

20:55.837 --> 20:57.506
Little girl…

20:59.716 --> 21:01.593
Leave the rest to me!

21:07.766 --> 21:08.767
Wait!

21:09.518 --> 21:11.728
It's an Upper Rank! Upper Rank Four!

23:08.053 --> 23:09.012
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC
NO. 9

23:14.935 --> 23:17.854
What about our screen time?

23:18.897 --> 23:21.316
Hey, when do I go out?

23:23.235 --> 23:25.654
I don't sense the enemy at all.

23:25.737 --> 23:27.322
Where's the enemy?

23:27.405 --> 23:29.908
I said we don't get any screen time!

23:33.036 --> 23:36.289
Then we'll finish our mission
and go on to the next one.

23:36.373 --> 23:39.793
Next up, Episode 10:
"Love Hashira Mitsuri Kanroji."

23:39.876 --> 23:42.295
Beat that Upper Rank!

23:42.379 --> 23:44.339
You understand, Senbachiro?

23:44.422 --> 23:46.007
TO BE CONTINUED
